# Dev Notes 24 — Worker Layout Option C Cancellation Core v1

## Date

2026-06-07

## Branch

```text
worker-layout-option-c-cancellation-core-v1
```

## Purpose

This branch continues Worker Layout Option C by extracting worker cancellation-core leaf helpers from `llama_worker/llama.mjs` while keeping `llama_worker/llama.mjs` as the stable worker entrypoint and composition root.

The extraction is intentionally narrow:

- active request registry helpers;
- request-boundary wait helpers.

